  "fullDescription": "Add a touch of luxury and festive sophistication to your designs with this stunning collection of Navy & Gold Christmas Seamless Papers. These elegant patterns feature deep navy backgrounds paired with shimmering gold accents, including baubles, stars, snowflakes, ornaments, holly, branches, glitter touches, festive motifs, ribbons, and metallic decorative details — all beautifully arranged in seamless repeat patterns that tile perfectly for smooth, continuous backgrounds.\nPerfect for holiday cards, wrapping paper, planners, stickers, scrapbooking, invitations, branding, packaging, digital journals, sublimation, wall art, gift tags, and seasonal stationery, these navy and gold designs give your projects a luxurious and modern Christmas aesthetic. The dark, rich tones paired with sparkling gold elements make these patterns ideal for upscale, elegant Christmas collections.\nEach pattern is provided as a high-resolution PNG in a 3:4 ratio, ensuring crisp details and a polished, premium look in both print and digital designs.",
